Builds native application hosts and generates plugin registration

Usage: leptoskit native <COMMAND>

Commands:
  bundle   Compiles the native Wasm guest and compatibility descriptor for code push
  prepare  Regenerates host projects and registrants and compiles their Rust inputs
  build    Produces an Apple application bundle, Android APK, or HarmonyOS HAP
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
